<section class="ref-group"><h2>Battles <span class="n">75</span></h2><ul class="enc-list"><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-narva-1700"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Narva (1700)</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1700</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Narva was fought in 1700 at the start of the Great Northern War, when about 8,000 Swedish troops under Charles XII routed a much larger Russian army…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-toubacanti"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Toubacanti</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1700</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Toubacanti was fought in February 1700 in Darién, present-day Panama, when Scottish colonists of the second Darien expedition under Captain Alexander…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-feyiase"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Feyiase</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1701</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Feyiase was fought in 1701 between the Asante and the Denkyira, the dominant Akan power of the region to which the Asante had paid tribute.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-blenheim"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-blenheim.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Blenheim</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1704</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Blenheim was fought on 13 August 1704 near the village of Blindheim on the Danube in Bavaria, during the War of the Spanish Succession.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-ramillies"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-ramillies.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Ramillies</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1706</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Ramillies was fought on 23 May 1706 near the village of Ramillies in Brabant, in present-day Belgium, during the War of the Spanish Succession.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-almansa"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-almansa.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Almansa</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1707</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Almansa was fought on 25 April 1707 near Almansa in south-eastern Spain during the War of the Spanish Succession.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-holowczyn"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-holowczyn.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Holowczyn</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1708</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Holowczyn was fought in 1708 in present-day Belarus during the Great Northern War.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-kanzhal"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Kanzhal</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1708</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Kanzhal was fought in 1708 near Mount Kanzhal in Kabarda, in the North Caucasus.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-oudenarde"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-oudenarde.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Oudenarde</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1708</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Oudenarde was fought on 11 July 1708 on the Scheldt in the Spanish Netherlands, where an allied army under the Duke of Marlborough and Prince Eugene of…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-poltava"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-poltava.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Poltava</span><span class="enc-t