ip">The Battle of Bulanty was a victory of the united forces of the three Kazakh juzes over the Dzungars near the Bulanty River, in what is now central Kazakhstan, around…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-palkhed"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Palkhed</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1728</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Palkhed was fought in February 1728 near Aurangabad between the Maratha Peshwa Baji Rao I and Nizam-ul-Mulk of Hyderabad.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-anyrakai"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Anyrakai</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · c. 1729–1730</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Anyrakai was fought around 1729–1730 in the Anyrakai Mountains of south-eastern Kazakhstan, near Lake Balkhash, between the Kazakhs and the Dzungars.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-murche-khort"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-murche-khort.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Murche-Khort</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1729</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Murche-Khort was fought in November 1729 north of Isfahan, when Nader, then general of the Safavid claimant Tahmasp II, defeated the Afghan army of the…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-hoton-nor"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Hoton Nor</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1731</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Hoton Nor was fought in the summer of 1731 near the lake of that name in western Mongolia, between the Dzungar Khanate and the Qing dynasty.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-bitonto"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-bitonto.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Bitonto</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1734</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Bitonto was fought on 25 May 1734 in Apulia during the War of the Polish Succession.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-ackia"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-ackia.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Ackia</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1736</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Ackia was fought on 26 May 1736 near modern Tupelo, Mississippi, when a French army under Jean-Baptiste Le Moyne de Bienville, governor of Louisiana, with…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-karnal"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-karnal.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Karnal</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1739</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Karnal was fought in 1739 north of Delhi between Nader Shah of Iran and the Mughal emperor Muhammad Shah.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-porto-bello"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Porto Bello</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1739</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Porto Bello was a British naval attack in November 1739 on Porto Bello, a Spanish port on the Caribbean coast of Panama.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-colachel"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-colachel.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Colachel</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1741</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Colachel was fought in August 1741 at the port of Colachel on the south-western coast of India, where the army of Marthanda Varma of Travancore defeated a…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-mollwitz"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Mollwitz</span><span clas